WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.902
An incorrect impression of confirmation needs a visible correction

00:00:04.784 --> 00:00:07.757
If Daniel has already sent a message that implies

00:00:07.823 --> 00:00:11.021
the slot is confirmed he explains the correction to

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:14.994
the affected recipients the slot remains pending the claimed

00:00:15.021 --> 00:00:18.205
approval is being checked and the conflicts still need

00:00:18.205 --> 00:00:22.284
a decision He updates the current controlled record so

00:00:22.336 --> 00:00:25.363
that people do not act on the earlier misunderstanding

00:00:26.257 --> 00:00:29.744
Quietly replacing an attachment would not reliably correct what

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:30.942
recipients believe
